# Links the checker cannot verify — one regex per line.
#
# These hosts serve a Cloudflare bot challenge ("Just a moment...") to every
# automated client, so they answer 403 for BOTH live and deleted pages —
# checked 2026-08-10 with curl and a real browser engine, including a URL
# known not to exist. A link check can prove nothing either way here, so
# they are excluded rather than accepted globally (a 403 from any other host
# is still reported). Re-verify these by hand when revising the lessons.
^https://www\.cloudflare\.com/learning/
^https://net\.educause\.edu/
^https://www\.iso\.org/
